            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Hogan, Lauren and Martinez, Maira. (2020). Continuous Improvement in Practice: Findings from Schools and Districts in California. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/tq527zt8348",
